---
import MainLayout from "../layouts/MainLayout.astro";
const steps = [
  [
    "Discover the right fit",
    "Browse listings and supplier profiles. Save promising businesses and products for later.",
  ],
  [
    "Describe what you need",
    "Send a direct enquiry or create a request for quotes with your requirements, quantity, location and deadline.",
  ],
  [
    "Discuss and compare",
    "Talk with suppliers, share relevant files and compare price, currency, lead time and terms before accepting.",
  ],
  [
    "Track your agreement",
    "Follow preparation, shipping and receipt. Both businesses confirm completion before eligible reviews.",
  ],
  [
    "Keep your company organized",
    "Use company roles, permissions and account tools to keep your team's work in the right hands.",
  ],
];
---

<MainLayout title="How Salam Sourcing Marketplace works"
  ><section class="container reading section">
    <p class="eyebrow">Trade should feel human</p><h1>
      From the first enquiry to your next business relationship.
    </h1><p class="mt-6">
      Salam Sourcing Marketplace connects buyers and suppliers through a B2B
      sourcing workflow. Clear information and direct conversations help
      businesses make considered decisions.
    </p><div class="stack mt-8">
      {
        steps.map(([title, text], index) => (
          <article class="card">
            <>
              <p class="eyebrow">0{index + 1}</p>
              <h2>{title}</h2>
              <p>{text}</p>
            </>
          </article>
        ))
      }
    </div><p class="mt-8">
      Participating businesses agree their own contracts, payment and delivery
      arrangements. A sourcing quote or deal summary is not a payment receipt or
      delivery guarantee.
    </p><div class="actions">
      <a class="button" href="/signup">Create an account</a><a
        class="text-link"
        href="/help">Ask a question</a
      >
    </div>
  </section></MainLayout
>
